OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAberfan disaster 'most tragic of
OL,4,Adays imaginable' says King on 60th
OL,5,Aanniversary
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles III, Queen Camilla and the
OL,8,FPrince of Wales joined survivors and
OL,9,Fbereaved families on Wednesday and laid
OL,10,Fwreaths and a posy with the last
OL,11,Fsurviving teacher in the Aberfan
OL,12,FMemorial Garden, located on the site of
OL,13,Fthe school.
OL,15,FThe King also paid tribute to the
OL,16,Fcommunity's strength, resilience and
OL,17,F"unconquerable spirit".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
